  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to suggest a change to the VRCStations script for both SDK2 and Udon.\nBasically, I'd love additional buttons, or maybe a drop down that allows the developer to specify what their station will do to the avatar.\nCurrently there's no real simple way to go enable gestures for a station or disable tracking on a station. It'd be real cool if I could just disable the arm bones but allow for hand tracking/facial gestures when seated. If I want to disallow leg/arm tracking I'd need to break all tracking (including head) to get it to work. A couple of check boxes or a drop down menu would allow developers to be a lot more creative with their stations without having to worry about their animation clips breaking things.",
